# Cline & Roo Code Agent Guidelines — paper-to-learning-path

This workspace includes the `paper-to-learning-path` skill.

When asked to convert, translate, or explain any research paper (PDF), or create a prerequisite learning path:
1. Refer to `.agents/skills/paper-to-learning-path/SKILL.md` for full instructions.
2. Execute the python pipeline scripts in `.agents/skills/paper-to-learning-path/scripts/`.
3. Never modify or translate mathematical equations (`$...$`, `$$...$$`, `\[...\]`).
4. Generate self-contained HTML files using the nature-inspired design system.
